.invitation-actions form{flex:1 1 180px}.invitation-actions button{width:100%;font-size:13px}\n.invitation-actions form[action$="/invitations/revoke"] button{background:#40282C;border-color:#C66E76;color:#FFCDD2}\n.invitation-actions form[action$="/invitations/revoke"] button:hover{background:#533038;border-color:#E58F98}\n.site-footer{padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #2C2D34;color:#B4BAC0;font-size:12px}\n@media(max-width:860px){.members-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-areas:"intro" "invite" "lists";max-width:650px;padding-top:32px}.header-content{gap:12px}nav{gap:20px}h1{font-size:40px}}\n@media(max-width:480px){.header-content,.members-layout,.site-footer{width:calc(100% - 32px)}.brand img{width:120px}nav{gap:12px}nav a{font-size:13px}.invite-card,.members-card{padding:20px}h1{font-size:36px}h2{font-size:24px}.member-row{gap:8px}.invitation-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}\n</style></head>\n<body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>\n<header class="site-header"><div class="header-content"><a class="brand" href="/nested/" aria-label="Thermus home"><img src="/assets/thermus-logo.svg" alt="thermus" width="166" height="40"></a>\n<nav aria-label="Workspace"><a href="/nested/">Product / Connect</a><a href="/nested/members" >Members</a><a href="/nested/logging" aria-current="page">Audit logs</a><a href="/nested/organizations">Switch workspace</a></nav></div></header>\n<main id="main-content" class="members-layout logging-layout"><div class="introduction"><p class="eyebrow">Workspace administration</p><h1>Audit logs</h1></div>\n<section class="invite-card" aria-labelledby="destination-heading"><h2 id="destination-heading">Audit log destination</h2>\n<section class="logging-result" role="alert" aria-labelledby="logging-result-title"><h3 id="logging-result-title">Test result suppressed</h3><p>Settings saved. The saved settings could not be matched. Read saved settings before another Test. Test proves neither continued delivery nor durable storage. Test is not required to enable export.</p></section>\n<p>Save one destination for your organization's audit logs. Thermus system logs are internal.</p>\n<aside class="destination-notice" role="note" aria-label="Organization data"><p>Send organization data only if you have authority to do so. Check destination access and retention. Read our <a href="https://thermus.ai/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p></aside>\n<form method="post" action="/nested/logging/save">\n<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="csrf"><input type="hidden" name="organization_id" value="trusted:a"><input type="hidden" name="expected_revision" value="r1">\n<fieldset id="logging-destination"><legend>Destination</legend><label class="role-option"><input type="radio" name="destination" value="axiom" required> Axiom</label>\n<label class="role-option"><input type="radio" name="destination" value="custom" required checked> Custom</label></fieldset>\n<label for="logging-endpoint">OTLP logs endpoint</label><input id="logging-endpoint" name="endpoint" type="url" maxlength="2048" required pattern="https://.*" aria-describedby="logging-endpoint-help" value="https://collector.example/v1/logs">\n<p id="logging-endpoint-help">Use an HTTPS OTLP/HTTP JSON logs endpoint.</p>\n<div id="logging-axiom-fields"><label for="logging-dataset">Axiom dataset</label><input id="logging-dataset" name="axiom_dataset" type="text" maxlength="128" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9\\-]{1,128}" aria-describedby="logging-dataset-help" value="">\n<p id="logging-dataset-help">Required for Axiom: 1–128 letters, digits, or hyphens.</p></div>\n<noscript><p>For Axiom, enter a dataset. For Custom, clear the Axiom dataset.</p></noscript>\n<input type="hidden" name="auth" value="bearer">\n<label for="logging-token">Bearer token</label><input id="logging-token" name="token" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" maxlength="8192" aria-describedby="logging-token-help" value="">\n<p id="logging-token-help">A token is saved. Leave Token blank to keep it for the same endpoint. A changed endpoint needs `... 1278 more characters,
    expected: /Save your edits before Test/,
    operator: 'match',
    diff: 'simple'
  }
